Preston Fairmont
Townsfolk
You start knowing a word. Each night*, you learn the character of one other player who publically said the word yesterday.

reminder 15 Connected
firstnight Show the secret word.
othernight If any player publically said the word yesterday, show Preston Fairmont the character of one of those players.
wakes first after pixie
wakes other after empath

